     https://github.com/mangdangroboticsclub/mini_pupper_ros (commit c3ad28c),
     Copyright 2022-2026 MANGDANG TECHNOLOGY CO., LIMITED, Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE and NOTICE here).
     Modified for this project: the xacro was expanded without ROS; the ros2_control and Gazebo tags and the
     camera placeholder visual were removed; the mesh paths were made relative; the joint damping and friction
     were reduced to 0.01 and 0.005; the body collision mesh was replaced by a box; and a tray with a payload link (the randomised load during training) was added. -->
